Ravana vows never to yield Sita despite gods --- Ravana climbs white palace and views countless monkeys --- Ravana asks Sarana to name heroes and leaders --- Sarana names roaring Nila leading van at front --- Sarana names heir Angada challenging duel with vast throng --- Sarana names Kumuda Rambha Sharabha craving Lanka crushing --- Sarana names Panasa drumming battle amid Pariyatra host --- Sarana names Vinata Krathana Gavaya thirsting for war --- Sarana calls countless shape-shifting chiefs irresistible
